<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <title>Question Reply</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f4f7; padding: 24px;">
  <div style="max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 32px;">
    <h2 style="color: #1a1a1a;">You've got a reply</h2>
    <p>Hi <%= name %>,</p>
    <p>A reply has been added to your question in the video <strong><%= title %></strong>.</p>
    <p>Please log in to view the reply and continue the discussion.</p>
    <p>Thank you!</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
